Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Bluetooth support package for the OnePlus Pad 3 (erhai)
 Since 2.2 this package no longer ships per-device address machinery. The
 shared DTB address (C0:FF:EE:13:1E:1A) is used for all devices; BT comes up
